arm: DEBUG_LL backend that writes to a DRAM ring (Nest J49 has no debug UART)

Decompressor/head.S breadcrumbs, a 64 KB ring at 0x83e80000 (two copies), mapped
early via debug_ll_io_init() in omap3_map_io(). Read back from stock after a warm
reset with tools/kernel-firstlight/decode-postmortem.py.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific debug tooling]
Signed-off-by: J49 project <j49@users.noreply.github.com>

